# Keep the build context small and secret-free. Host node_modules hold pnpm symlinks
# that are useless (and wrong) inside the image; .env and session logs must never be baked in.
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.superpowers
.history
.claude
data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
tests
tools
orchestrator
scripts
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
